\p[style=Title]{Quarterly report}

= Summary {#sec:summary}

Revenue grew by *12%* to $48.2M, mostly from _new_ customers.\footnote{Unaudited figures.}
See @tbl:rev for the numbers and @sec:outlook for what comes next.

